---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-footer-inner">
    <div class="site-footer-columns">
      <div>
        <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5">
            <ellipse cx="24" cy="43" rx="12.5" ry="2.2" fill="rgb(255 255 255 / 0.18)" />
            <path
              d="M24 4.5c-9.2 0-16.6 7.4-16.6 16.6v11.2c0 4 3.3 7.2 7.2 7.2h18.8c4 0 7.2-3.2 7.2-7.2V21.1C40.6 11.9 33.2 4.5 24 4.5Z"
              fill="white"
            />
            <path d="M16.2 18.1h15.6a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v4.8a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H16.2a5 5 0 0 1-5-5v-4.8a5 5 0 0 1 5-5Z" fill="#b9c7d8" />
            <path d="M16.8 18.7h14.5a4.1 4.1 0 0 1 4.1 4.1v3.9a4.1 4.1 0 0 1-4.1 4.1H16.8a4.1 4.1 0 0 1-4.1-4.1v-3.9a4.1 4.1 0 0 1 4.1-4.1Z" fill="#8ea0b6" />
            <path d="M12.3 20.9h-2.9a1.9 1.9 0 0 0-1.9 1.9v5.3a1.9 1.9 0 0 0 1.9 1.9h2.9v-9.1ZM35.7 20.9h2.9a1.9 1.9 0 0 1 1.9 1.9v5.3a1.9 1.9 0 0 1-1.9 1.9h-2.9v-9.1Z" fill="white" />
            <path d="M18 38h12v3.8H18z" fill="white" />
            <path d="M17.1 41.8h13.8v1.8H17.1z" fill="white" />
            <circle cx="16" cy="23.1" r="1.1" fill="white" />
          </svg>
          <span>Space Nerd</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          A calm reference for shuttles, worlds, and the journeys that connect them—written for curiosity, not noise.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-sm text-slate-500">
        <p class="font-medium text-slate-400">Imagery</p>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
          Home — looping launch video (Mixkit free license,
          <a
            class="text-slate-400 underline decoration-slate-600 underline-offset-2 hover:text-slate-300"
            href="https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/space-shuttle-launching-in-a-giant-plume-of-smoke-as-45230/"
            >item 45230</a
          >) with NASA still poster (KSC-2009-2069). ISS — looping station-orbit hero video from Mixkit (item 47398).
          Jobs — looping career-focused hero video from Mixkit (item 46635). Control Room — looping hero video from
          Mixkit (item 23667). Mars — looping hero video from Mixkit (item 44883). Moon — looping lunar-activity hero
          video from Mixkit (item 44926). Shuttles — orbiter photos via Wikimedia Commons (NASA images). Earth —
          three.js globe texture and Apollo 17 “Blue Marble” in
          <code class="text-slate-500">/images/</code> (public domain).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="site-footer-copy">
      © {year} Space Nerd · Educational overview · Verify mission details with primary sources (e.g. NASA).
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
